            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 31.213379,
              "lng": 121.440765
            },
            "type_base": "Secondhand Books & Designer Clothing",
            "type_local": "二手书籍&设计师服装",
            "cost": 50,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "optional": false,
            "time": {
              "start": "12:45",
              "end": "13:05"
            },
            "notes_base": "[ANFU ROAD] Three-story secondhand concept store in converted 1970s film building. Floor 2: ~13,000 curated books (3-4x off original price). Floor 3: ~1,500+ secondhand designer clothing (~2.5x off). Floor 1: art exhibitions with famous 405-tile cat-brick wall. The ONLY remaining physical Duozhuayu store in all of China. Open 10:00-22:00. Name from French 'Déjà Vu'.",
            "notes_local": "【安福路】由1970年代电影建筑改造的三层二手概念店。2楼：约13000本精选书籍（3-4折）。3楼：1500+件二手设计师服装（约2.5折）。1楼：艺术展览，有著名的405块猫砖墙。全中国唯一的多抓鱼实体店。营业时间10:00-22:00。",
            "search_results": [
