            "notes_base": "[HUAIHAI ROAD] TX Huaihai (TX淮海) is Shanghai's premier youth culture destination on Huaihai Zhonglu 523. Multi-floor open-concept mall focused on streetwear, sneakers, independent designer brands, skate culture, and pop-up events. Also known as 锦江国际购物中心. Rating 4.8/5. Open Mon-Sun 11:00-22:00. Key stop on the Huaihai Road route - centrally located between Anfu Road and other Huaihai Road stores.",
            "notes_local": "【淮海路】TX淮海是上海顶级青年文化目的地，位于淮海中路523号。多层开放式购物中心，专注于街头服饰、球鞋、独立设计师品牌、滑板文化及快闪活动。又名锦江国际购物中心。评分4.8。周一至周日11:00-22:00。位于安福路与淮海路其他门店之间，是淮海路路线上的核心站点。",
